# AGENTS.md (template)

This is the template for the substrate-neutral orchestration guide that every managed project should have at its root. The format is intentionally compatible with OpenAI Codex, Cursor, MindStone, and other agent-harnesses that consume `AGENTS.md` at project root.

Replace the bracketed placeholders with project-specific content. Delete sections that don't apply.

---

